{"id":"fa_higkeit","lemma":"Fähigkeit","pos":"noun","rank":1699,"glosses":["ability, capability"],"ipa":"/ˈfɛːɪçkaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/De-F%C3%A4higkeit.ogg/De-F%C3%A4higkeit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Fähigkeit","plural":"Fähigkeiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich glaube an meine Fähigkeit.","en":"I believe in my abilities.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760842","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Er vertraut seinen Fähigkeiten.","en":"He is confident of his ability.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"close, intimate"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich vertraue wirklich auf seine Fähigkeit.","en":"I really trust his ability.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to trust","l":"vertrauen"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Hast du irgendwelche übernatürliche Fähigkeiten?","en":"Do you have any supernatural abilities?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"any"},{"g":"supernatural","l":"übernatürlich"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben die Fähigkeit, das zu tun.","en":"We have the ability to do that.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}